{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A  Must-Try", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class =\"italic\">\u201cI wish\u2026\u201d</span> to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The verb <span class =\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. After <span class =\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I wish I knew ... <br/>I wish I had ... <br/>I wish you were ... ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/>Wish + Simple Past tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish it came with rice instead of potatoes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want it to come with rice, but it comes with potatoes.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish I had a good recipe for stir-fry.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to have a good recipe for stir-fry, but I don't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish we were going to Ned's.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to go to Ned's, but I'm not going there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish we served lobster!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like us to serve lobster, but we don't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. This is a polite way of communicating if you use the modals <span class =\"italic\">would</span> or <span class =\"italic\">could</span>.<br/><br/><span class =\"italic\">I would ... <br/>I wouldn't ... <br/>You could ... ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These are examples of Peter and Vanessa giving suggestions about how to deal with problems. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I was disappointed with the meal.  I'll have to talk to the chef.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wouldn't worry about it, Vanessa. Maybe he just had a bad day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm a bit stressed, because Tracy is coming over.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would practice the recipe first.  ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "must-try", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you have to taste", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Here's a must-try: baked chicken in mushroom sauce. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about food.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "stir-fry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a way of cooking by mixing ingredients like meat and vegetables in a large pan", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I usually get the beef and broccoli stir-fry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "drumstick", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part of the chicken you eat", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should order the baked chicken drumsticks.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "oven-roasted", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes food that has been cooked in the oven, usually over a long period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It comes with oven-roasted Greek potatoes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cod", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of white fish", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Today, I think I'll have the lemon baked cod. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "frustrated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling frustration; not getting what you want", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm a bit frustrated, because all my recipes are boring.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find a large piece of paper the size of a poster.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Draw a line dividing the paper in half, and then lines dividing it into 4 more sections to make a total of 8 sections (see example below). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "On the left side, write adjectives ending in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">frustrated</span>. Try to find different adjectives than the example.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "On the right side, write adjectives ending in <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">exciting</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask 10 people questions starting with: <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWhen do you feel ...\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWhat do you find ...\u201d</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write their answers in the correct category.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your poster with a partner or the class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"excited:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exciting:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frustrated:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frustrating:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tired:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tiring:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bored:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"boring:\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I ask people about their feelings and reactions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write explanations for feelings and reactions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the information.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you tell me what is new on the menu? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Yes, here's a must-try: baked chicken drumsticks in mushroom sauce. It comes with oven-roasted Greek potatoes. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds interesting, but I wish it came with rice instead of potatoes. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  We can give you rice. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  OK, perfect!  I'll have that.  What are you going to order?"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "21250", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I usually get the beef and broccoli stir-fry, but I was disappointed with it last time.  I'll have to talk to the chef. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wouldn't worry about it, Vanessa. Maybe he just had a bad day.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Maybe you're right.  Today, I think I'll have the lemon baked cod.  It's new on the menu.  I'm excited to try it."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "41000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I had a good recipe for stir-fry. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's so easy! It's a very popular item. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you tell me how to make it? My stir-fries are so boring.  I'm a bit frustrated, because Tracy is coming over. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I would practice the recipe first. We could do a stir-fry next weekend. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks!"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about feelings and reactions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When do you feel frustrated? Tired? Excited?  Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you find frustrating? Tiring? Exciting?  Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type":